    "created_at": "2023-02-01T09:16:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-02-01T09:16:59Z",
    "body": "@imgnue are you sure this issue is because of zoxide? The only time zoxide starts up a binary is:\r\n\r\n- when you make a query\r\n- when you enter a new directory, via zsh's `chpwd_hook`\r\n\r\nBoth times, it's started up synchronously, so you should not be seeing background job indicators from zoxide.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
