    "updated_at": "2023-02-26T04:56:11Z",
    "body": "I use zoxide with fish as well and don't see this issue.\nI think this issue might manifest if zoxide is initialized after starship is, as is done in the issue author's config.\nPlease be sure to have starship init be the last line of your shell's config file.",
