    "created_at": "2023-02-28T23:22:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-02-28T23:22:39Z",
    "body": "Can confirm that the issue is gone after swapping the 2 eval lines in my bashrc:\r\n```bash\r\neval \"$(zoxide init bash)\"\r\neval \"$(starship init bash)\"\r\n```\r\nMight be worth digging into so that the order won't matter for users who installed starship first then zoxide.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
